	};

And use it everywhere. Right now you `ScreenSpaceContactShadowsMode` to set the size of the pipeline array and nothing else. IMO for user-facing stuff, low, medium, high quality are much better than exposing the raw sample count, especially if there is only a few fixed options in an enum.

